  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Wordless Chorus** (1 review): Listener cited Wordless Chorus and Dondante as personal highlights of the performance [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **September 2021 (Tuesday)**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Lucky To Be Alive**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Regularly Scheduled Programming, Feel You, Climbing The Ladder, Wasted [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2021-09-07.vwmule** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 121 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Listener states the band sounded great in person and the recording captures that quality [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The reviewer attended their first My Morning Jacket show and left before the closer [2]\n- Listener describes the Merriweather Post Pavilion as a beloved DMV venue with a strong community [3]\n- Attendees were required to show proof of full vaccination or a negative test [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2021-09-07.vwmule**: taped by Alex Leary; transferred by Alex Leary; source: Microtech Gefell M21 > nBob actives > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [1]. Also: Transfer processed from MP6 to iMac, tracked in Sound Studio, and encoded to FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Kyle Gustafson: [Live Review: My Morning Jacket @ Merriweather Post Pavilion — 9/7/21 | Parklife DC](https://parklifedc.com/2021/09/10/live-review-my-morning-jacket-merriweather-post-pavilion-9-7-21/) [5]",
